{"OFFER_HELP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"Bless you, yes, God, yes, I'd love some help, I really would","You're an angel, an honest-to-goodness angel, thank you!!","Yes, please, I've been struggling alone, and it's wearing me thin","I was just about to ask, how did you know?","Yeah, please, I'm about worn out","Wonderful -- there's a hundred things to do, pick one","Thank you, thank you, you have no idea how much this means","I'd hug you, but I don't want to scare you, so, thanks, thanks a million","Honestly, I could use a hand, a strong one, like yours","You're always the first to offer, I wish I could repay you","Yes, and I'll gladly return the favor someday, somehow","Come on, then, we could use a hero today","You're a lifesaver, you always are","You're too kind, but yes, absolutely","You've already done so much, but, yes, please, if you're sure","You make this world a little less awful, thank you","How can I refuse? Thank you, my friend","Yes! Yes, that would be wonderful","You read my mind, I was about to ask for help","Fantastic, welcome aboard, we need you!!","With you around -- I feel hopeful again","Let's do this together, you and me","Oh, thank God, finally someone who understands!!","I'd be grateful, really grateful","That's the nicest thing anyone's said to me all day","Sure, if I can do something for you in return","You're a good egg, you know that?","Sure, we'll find you something to do","You make it feel like we might make it","A thousand thanks, and a thousand more","You're a blessing, you really are"}},
