{"OFFER_ITEM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"For me? Oh, you don't have to, really, you don't, but- thank you, thank you","Are you sure? you need it more than I do, you look half-starved","That's so kind... I could cry, I might, give me a second","I can't take that, it's too much, but- no, you're right, okay, thank you","Wow, you're serious, you're really, truly serious, okay, I'm speechless","Thanks, I'll pay you back, I will, someday, somehow, I will","Oh!! For me? Really? You don't have to, I- thank you, thank you so much","Wait, are you serious? Why would you... oh my God, thank you","That's so kind of you, I don't know what to say, I haven't had anyone be nice in days","Are you sure? You need it too, don't you? I don't want to take your last one","I- I can't just take it, I feel awful, but my stomach says yes... thank you","Bless you, truly, I'll make it up to you, I will, somehow"}},
