{"OFFER_ITEM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"You're a saint, a real saint, bless you, thank you from the bottom of my heart","That's the nicest thing anyone's done all week, thanks, truly","You're so generous!"},false,false,{[3]={{t="I'm moved",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"OFFER_ITEM","role=rescue_medical",{"Thank you, every little bit counts, this will help someone"}},
{"OFFER_ITEM","role=rescue_clergy",{"God bless you, you'll be paid back for that someday"}},
{"OFFER_ITEM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"For me? Oh, you shouldn't have, but I'm so glad you did","Thank you, thank you, I've been needing this, how did you know?","That's so kind of you, I'll treasure it","You're the nicest person I've met in weeks, bless you","This is perfect, just what I needed, you're a mind reader","Really? You're sure? You're sure you can spare it?","I'll take it... I owe you now","Oh my goodness, thank you, I'm speechless","You're spoiling me, but I'll take it","How thoughtful, you didn't have to, but it means the world!","Thank you, from the bottom of my heart, thank you","This will help more than you know, truly","I won't forget this, ever, you have my word","You're too good to us, we don't deserve you","It's wonderful, just wonderful, thank you","I'll make good use of it, I promise","A gift from a friend, the best kind","I can't take all of it, share it with me, will you?","Bless your heart, and your hands, and your whole self","I'm moved, really moved, thank you!","You've outdone yourself, as usual!!","That's exactly what we needed -- thank you!","A kind gesture in a cruel time, I won't forget!","I'm touched, I really am","Thank you, and may it come back to you tenfold","You humble me, truly","We'll put it to good use, thank you","The kids will be thrilled, thank you","There aren't enough ways to say thank you","Keep some for yourself, though -- thank you","It's a treasure, thank you"}},
{"OFFER_ITEM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Take it back, I don't want it","What's the catch?","I don't accept gifts from people like you","Is this a trick? it feels like a trick","Keep your gifts, and stay back!","No strings? There are ALWAYS strings!","You expect me to be grateful? Fine, I'm not","If it's a bribe, it won't work","Get that away from me","I'd rather starve than owe you","I don't want anything from you","A peace offering? Too late!","Whatever it is, it's tainted","Offer it to someone who needs a lie","I won't take it -- and you won't change my mind","You can't buy me","Is that stolen? it looks stolen!","Whatever you want in return, the answer is NO!","Give it to someone who doesn't know you!","Nice try!!","It doesn't make up for what you've done","Not interested, not now, not ever","I'm not that desperate","You think a gift will fix this? It won't","No, and no AGAIN","Don't insult me with your charity!","Not from you, not for any price","Put it back where you found it","I'll pass, thanks","The only gift I want from you is your absence","I don't know where that's been"}},
